cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use (E)Gasboard, please cite this software."
title: "(E)Gasboard"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Egas"
    given-names: "Reinier A."

version: "0.1"

abstract: >-
  (E)Gasboard is a browser-based tool for gas calculations in closed
  incubations and microcosms, including headspace, dissolved-gas,
  batch-calculation and gas-dosing calculations.

license: GPL-3.0-or-later

url: "https://egasboard.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AREGAS/egasboard"

